@startuml
title AndrORM 定義から実行までの全体シーケンス図
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam noteBorderColor #9E9E9E
skinparam ArrowColor #455A64
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #ECEFF1
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #455A64

autonumber
actor 開発者 as Dev
participant "テーブル定義Entity" as Definition
participant "KSP\nPropsProcessor" as KSP
participant "生成Entity" as Generated
participant "Query Builder" as Builder
participant "AndrOrmDatabaseHelper" as Helper
database "SQLite" as DB

Dev -> Definition : @Table / @Column / @Projectionを記述
Dev -> KSP : Gradleビルド
KSP -> Definition : シンボル・アノテーション取得
KSP -> KSP : Projection検証\nEntityMeta検証\nDEFAULT検証
alt 検証成功
  KSP -> Generated : 用途別data classを書き出す
else 検証失敗
  KSP --> Dev : KSP error / warning
end

Dev -> Builder : 生成Entityを指定してDSL構築
Builder -> Builder : SQL句を組み立てる
Builder -> Builder : プレースホルダー順にbindValues保持
Dev -> Helper : executeDml(builder)\nまたはexecuteSelect...(select)
Helper -> Builder : build()
Builder --> Helper : SQL
Helper -> Builder : bindValues
Helper -> DB : compileStatement / rawQuery
DB --> Helper : 件数 / Cursor
alt SELECT Entity形式
  Helper -> Helper : Mapへ変換
  Helper -> Generated : コンストラクタ呼出し
  Generated --> Helper : Entity
end
Helper --> Dev : 実行結果

@enduml
